      },
      "message": "docs(site): contributing with AI agents - start, issue-to-main flow, gotchas, several machines\n\nA developer page with what contributors running Claude Code and other agents\nlearned on this project: getting started (AGENTS.md, the project skills, the\nMCP server), the issue -> draft PR -> review -> merge flow with the PR body\nchecklist reviewers enforce, disk and sccache gotchas, running pools on more\nthan one machine, and using subagents. Links to the CamCraft Discord.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
